Subject: [PATCH 28/37] feat: wire main.py through signal generation, risk, and
 order submission

run() now completes the full cycle: candles -> validate -> indicators
-> regime -> strategy.pipeline.generate_trading_signal -> risk_
controller.approve_trade (with the real balance from
gateway.get_account_info()) -> if approved, an OrderRequest (stop/
target from execution.simulator.calculate_stop_target) submitted via
gateway.submit_order(). Previously stopped after regime detection.

Verified end-to-end against SimulationGateway: a realistic run (risk
engine correctly rejects most signals from synthetic random-walk
data) and a forced-approval run (confirms order construction and
submission through the gateway).

7 new tests covering the approved/rejected paths and confirming the
risk engine receives the real account balance, not a placeholder.
